 "image": "/trades-etf/stand.svg", "alt": "A · Folded stand — flat blank and separate lip. Read drawing A: a 10 1/2 × 4-in strip; folds 3, 6, and 10 in from datum A; final 1/2 in is a joining tab. Read written dimensions; the screen is NTS. The separate 4 × 1-in lip folds in half.", "prompt": "In the opening ten minutes, try holding a light card upright with scrap paper; notice why it falls.", "body": "Read written dimensions; this screen drawing is not to scale. Keep the supplied plan beside your physical work."}]}}, {"id": "mvp-etf-1-01-test", "type": "prose", "markdown": "Inspect the work against the plan and the performance requirement.", "workshop": {"pageBreakBefore": true, "stage": "Test", "title": "Test the project", "lead": "Inspect the work against the plan and the performance requirement.", "minutes": 15, "notebook": "Version 1 → test → physical change → comparable retest.", "steps": ["Place and remove the object three times. It must stand for ten seconds each time without a hand supporting it. Record pass/fail honestly.", "Compare one actual side length with its plan dimension. Record the difference and the effect of your revision."], "purpose": "Trades math • measuring and inspection • drawing/plan interpretation", "catchUp": ["Use a larger drawing, fraction strip or teacher-modeled example, then do a fresh measurement and calculation yourself.", "If absent or equipment is unavailable, complete the plan/math practice and arrange the actual practical check. Label unperformed tests pending; do not invent results."]}, "teachingMoment": {"phase": "discuss", "title": "Test", "purpose": "Inspect the work against the plan and the performance requirement."}, "teachingTool": {"kind": "case-board", "version": 1, "frames": [{"title": "A · Folded stand — flat blank and separate lip", "image": "/trades-etf/stand.svg", "alt": "A · Folded stand — flat blank and separate lip. Read drawing A: a 10 1/2 × 4-in strip; folds 3, 6, and 10 in from datum A; final 1/2 in is a j